lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-23T17:22:29Z"},"body":"This can avoid problems with cyclic references (and breakers).\r\nYou may think it's rare, but one such cyclic reference is currently occurring in `GDScript` compiler behavior and leading to half-destructed buffers being copied around. This is not leading to problems _right now_, because of a coincidental inefficiency in `CowData` is leading to a technically unnecessary fork of the data before double destruction can occur. In the worst case, the array would have been `reallocated` halfway through destruction, causing undefined behavior and possibly segmentation faults.\r\n\r\nMy PR removing the unnecessary forks (#100619) triggered the bug more harshly, and this led to very strange leaks occurring.\r\n\r\nImportantly, `master` currently fails this simple sanity check:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/75b7a03db68211ae68a9c01386472363dad69639\r\n\r\nThis PR no longer fails the sanity check. \r\n\r\nI also added a test to make sure there is no regression of this behavior.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100694/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100694/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}